# Example API Requests for Qik API

## Health Check
GET https://localhost:5001/api/qik/health

###

## Get Available Functions
GET https://localhost:5001/api/qik/functions

###

## Interpret Simple Script
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@name => \"John Doe\"; @greeting => \"Hello, \" + @name + \"!\";"
}

###

## Interpret with Variable Override
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@name => \"John\"; @greeting => \"Hello, \" + @name;",
  "variables": {
    "@name": "Alice"
  }
}

###

## Code Generation Example
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@className => \"UserService\"; @namespace => \"MyApp.Services\"; @property => camelCase(@className) + \"Instance\";"
}

###

## Extract UI Widgets
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "[title = \"User Name\", type = \"text\"] @userName => \"Guest\"; [title = \"Email Address\", type = \"email\"] @email => \"user@example.com\";"
}

###

## Evaluate Expression - Text Transformation
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "upperCase(@name)",
  "context": {
    "@name": "john doe"
  }
}

###

## Evaluate Expression - Multiple Functions
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "camelCase(replace(@input, \" \", \"_\"))",
  "context": {
    "@input": "Hello World Example"
  }
}

###

## Evaluate Expression - Date Formatting
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "currentDate(\"yyyy-MM-dd\")"
}

###

## Evaluate Expression - GUID Generation
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "guid(\"u\")"
}

###

## Evaluate Expression - Conditional (Ternary)
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "@count == \"0\" ? \"empty\" : \"has items\"",
  "context": {
    "@count": "5"
  }
}

###

## Complex Script - URL Builder
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@baseUrl => \"https://api.example.com\"; @endpoint => \"users/search\"; @query => \"john doe\"; @encodedQuery => urlEncode(@query); @fullUrl => @baseUrl + \"/\" + @endpoint + \"?q=\" + @encodedQuery;"
}

###

## Complex Script - HTML Generator
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@title => \"Welcome\"; @content => \"Hello World\"; @html => \"<!DOCTYPE html>\" + NEWLINE + \"<html>\" + NEWLINE + indentLine(\"<title>\" + htmlEncode(@title) + \"</title>\", TAB, 1) + NEWLINE + \"</html>\";"
}

###

## Complex Script - Conditional Logic
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@score => \"B\"; @color => if @score == \"A\" then \"green\" else if @score == \"B\" then \"yellow\" else \"red\";"
}

###

## Complex Script - Switch Statement
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@day => \"Saturday\"; @dayType => switch @day case \"Saturday\" then \"Weekend\" case \"Sunday\" then \"Weekend\" else \"Weekday\";"
}

###

## Encoding/Decoding - Base64
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/interpret
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "@original => \"Hello World\"; @encoded => base64Encode(@original); @decoded => base64Decode(@encoded);"
}

###

## Text Transformation Chain
POST https://localhost:5001/api/qik/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expression": "upperCase(camelCase(@input))",
  "context": {
    "@input": "hello world example"
  }
}

###
